(7499222, 1195118, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ah, I love medical imaging. The Lower left shows a kidney stone passing through the urethra. The upper right is an artery injected with air bubbles and the victim probably died from it, which is sad because he finally got rid of that kidney stone and had a bright future. The other stuff is garbage. People just don''t care where they throw it these days. I''ll give you a 10 for the great image and the fantastical story behind it.</td>', 'Ah, I love medical imaging. The Lower left shows a kidney stone passing through the urethra. The upper right is an artery injected with air bubbles and the victim probably died from it, which is sad because he finally got rid of that kidney stone and had a bright future. The other stuff is garbage. People just don''t care where they throw it these days. I''ll give you a 10 for the great image and the fantastical story behind it.', '2017-02-14 05:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
