(7500990, 1195163, 185714, '<td valign="top">Thank you DPC members for making an effort to guess my image.  <br/> <br/>Congrats to those who had guessed it correctly.  For those who did not guess it correctly, it is Ok.  Probably I did''nt execute my image properly.<br/> <br/>Will do my best the next time round.<br/> <br/>Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Gin Tay</td>', 'Thank you DPC members for making an effort to guess my image.   Congrats to those who had guessed it correctly.  For those who did not guess it correctly, it is Ok.  Probably I did''nt execute my image properly. Will do my best the next time round. Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image. CheersGin Tay', '2017-02-20 00:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
