(7501059, 1195233, 61396, '<td valign="top">what does it mean if the following two assessments are simultaneously correct?<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> The path my daddy took when he went to look for America </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Depending on your perspective, it could be the road to hell. ;-) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'what does it mean if the following two assessments are simultaneously correct? Originally posted by posthumous: The path my daddy took when he went to look for America  Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Depending on your perspective, it could be the road to hell. ;-) ', '2017-02-20 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
