(7501064, 1194727, 140305, '<td valign="top">My husband was sure this was a pancake. I informed him it was a macro but still he persisted. I guess from the other end of the couch (while drinking a beer and watching a hockey game) it could look like a pancake lol.</td>', 'My husband was sure this was a pancake. I informed him it was a macro but still he persisted. I guess from the other end of the couch (while drinking a beer and watching a hockey game) it could look like a pancake lol.', '2017-02-20 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501076, 1195233, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mitalapo:</b></div><hr/><i> what does it mean if the following two assessments are simultaneously correct?<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> The path my daddy took when he went to look for America </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Depending on your perspective, it could be the road to hell. ;-) </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''ll "leaf" that to your imagination.</td>', 'Originally posted by mitalapo: what does it mean if the following two assessments are simultaneously correct? Originally posted by posthumous: The path my daddy took when he went to look for America  Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Depending on your perspective, it could be the road to hell. ;-)    I''ll "leaf" that to your imagination.', '2017-02-20 11:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501086, 1195148, 182284, '<td valign="top">This was a gift from my friend who lives in Mississippi. She calls it a Holy rock. She has Renal cell carcinoma and is in treatment. This is in remembrance of everything she''s going through.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-02-23 16:43:09.</i></td>', 'This was a gift from my friend who lives in Mississippi. She calls it a Holy rock. She has Renal cell carcinoma and is in treatment. This is in remembrance of everything she''s going through.', '2017-02-20 12:17:35.000000', '2017-02-23 16:43:09.000000', 0),
