(7501106, 1195233, 69684, '<td valign="top">I like the graphical look, but I''m not happy here with the border and the color, I would prefer B&amp;W, but that''s just personal.<br/> <br/>Btw. I prefer this one above your outtake <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1195726" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Btw2. I hope this plant will grow. Thanks for the story!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-02-20 14:23:44.</i></td>', 'I like the graphical look, but I''m not happy here with the border and the color, I would prefer B&W, but that''s just personal. Btw. I prefer this one above your outtake   Btw2. I hope this plant will grow. Thanks for the story!', '2017-02-20 14:19:57.000000', '2017-02-20 14:23:44.000000', 0),
(7501109, 1195238, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> "And when I came to, the wolf was standing over me with my arm in its'' mouth." </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You realize that was a quote from the 69th line of the lyrics from the famous Pink Floyd song "Peeling Paint, Covered With Ice, Seen Through A Magnifying Glass, Which Is Reflecting A Pine Tree"? Mind blown, huh? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>whew, I''m glad somebody guessed my macro!</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Originally posted by Art Roflmao: "And when I came to, the wolf was standing over me with my arm in its'' mouth."  You realize that was a quote from the 69th line of the lyrics from the famous Pink Floyd song "Peeling Paint, Covered With Ice, Seen Through A Magnifying Glass, Which Is Reflecting A Pine Tree"? Mind blown, huh?   whew, I''m glad somebody guessed my macro!', '2017-02-20 14:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501112, 1195237, 15768, '<td valign="top">well deserved, dudski!</td>', 'well deserved, dudski!', '2017-02-20 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501125, 1195233, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hajeka:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the graphical look, but I''m not happy here with the border and the color, I would prefer B&amp;W, but that''s just personal.<br/> <br/>Btw. I prefer this one above your outtake <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1195726" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195726.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Btw2. I hope this plant will grow. Thanks for the story! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments. I took the outtake soon after the challenge was announced but was never happy with it so I was really happy when I found this leaf. I hope the plant grows but I''m not that confident right now.</td>', 'Originally posted by hajeka: I like the graphical look, but I''m not happy here with the border and the color, I would prefer B&W, but that''s just personal. Btw. I prefer this one above your outtake   Btw2. I hope this plant will grow. Thanks for the story!   Thanks for your comments. I took the outtake soon after the challenge was announced but was never happy with it so I was really happy when I found this leaf. I hope the plant grows but I''m not that confident right now.', '2017-02-20 17:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
